00:28:00.480 --> 00:28:02.080
I've made friends.

00:28:02.720 --> 00:28:04.960
But everyone's so tired so,

00:28:06.240 --> 00:28:09.920
they get a bit angry sometimes.

00:28:09.920 --> 00:28:11.520
Work together!

00:28:12.880 --> 00:28:14.160
Come on, stay strong!

00:28:14.160 --> 00:28:16.400
Don't fucking pull me back, push me!

00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:18.640
I'm doing that! Your back isn't straight!

00:28:18.640 --> 00:28:20.160
It's very difficult.

00:28:20.160 --> 00:28:22.080
I'm not very good, you see,

00:28:22.080 --> 00:28:23.920
and everyone makes mistakes in life

00:28:23.920 --> 00:28:25.680
and you start when you're young,

00:28:25.680 --> 00:28:29.280
up until you become a Colonel then
you can perfect everything.

00:28:29.280 --> 00:28:32.240
Help your smaller friends.
Somebody swap with him.

00:28:32.240 --> 00:28:33.760
Come here Barnard. Go there

00:28:37.040 --> 00:28:38.640
I like it here.

00:28:39.120 --> 00:28:40.880
All your friends are around you,

00:28:40.880 --> 00:28:44.400
they tell you stories about their dads in the army,

00:28:44.880 --> 00:28:47.440
and when they do that we think about our parents

00:28:48.080 --> 00:28:52.160
and then I think, wow,
I could be just like my dad one day.

00:29:06.240 --> 00:29:09.200
Deon is more of a bush person.

00:29:09.200 --> 00:29:11.360
Friends can bring lots of problems.

00:29:11.360 --> 00:29:13.360
We also don't have any friends and stuff.

00:29:13.360 --> 00:29:16.320
Because we believe that too many friends
and material possessions

00:29:16.320 --> 00:29:18.560
can bring problems. We don't do that.

00:29:18.560 --> 00:29:20.320
It's all about our family,

00:29:20.320 --> 00:29:24.400
and the time God has granted us with our family.
That's how we raise them.

00:29:24.400 --> 00:29:29.520
At night he is not out on the streets and
we brought up our daughters the same way.

00:29:30.960 --> 00:29:33.840
You'll see, Deon isn't interested in watching rugby.

00:29:33.840 --> 00:29:37.120
We don't watch any rugby,
you'll see we don't even have TV's.

00:29:37.120 --> 00:29:39.440
We believe that sport has become the
god in this country.

00:29:39.440 --> 00:29:41.120
We don't want anything to do with that.

00:29:41.120 --> 00:29:43.840
Deon has a TV in his room where he watches DVDs,

00:29:43.840 --> 00:29:46.000
but only DVDs that we've approved.

00:29:46.000 --> 00:29:47.520
Put in a little water.

00:29:47.920 --> 00:29:51.520
Our family isn't on BBM or Facebook
or anything of that sort.

00:29:51.520 --> 00:29:54.160
We're not looking for sinful things.
Those are sinful.

00:29:54.640 --> 00:29:56.800
Yes, they still give me hidings.

00:29:56.800 --> 00:29:58.960
If I do something wrong

00:29:58.960 --> 00:30:01.840
And it is painful, but you have to learn.

00:30:01.840 --> 00:30:05.440
Like, look at the white kids of today.

00:30:05.440 --> 00:30:07.520
The new generation. The new age.

00:30:07.520 --> 00:30:11.680
The wear tongue rings, they drink, they smoke.

00:30:11.680 --> 00:30:16.160
They use drugs and have tattoos.

00:30:16.160 --> 00:30:17.680
I don't want to be like that one day.

00:30:17.680 --> 00:30:20.240
I want to keep my body clean.
I won't drink. I won't smoke.

00:30:20.240 --> 00:30:22.960
I won't get any tattoos. I won't use drugs.

00:30:23.200 --> 00:30:24.320
It looks good.

00:30:24.320 --> 00:30:26.000
Maybe a bit too much oil.

00:30:26.000 --> 00:30:28.400
Deon doesn't play TV games and things like that.

00:30:28.400 --> 00:30:30.800
We say he must rather do other things, like,

00:30:30.800 --> 00:30:33.680
Deon can shoot very well. More things for himself.
- More practical things.

00:30:33.680 --> 00:30:35.920
More practical things that will develop him.

00:30:36.560 --> 00:30:38.800
Otherwise he only develops his head.

00:30:38.800 --> 00:30:41.520
And he'll walk around like a kid
with a swollen head.

00:30:48.800 --> 00:30:51.600
This is the longest period
in five years.

