00:46:52.960 --> 00:46:56.560
They want you to believe that you're
part of the Rainbow Nation.

00:46:56.560 --> 00:46:59.600
So they give you a flag that means different things.

00:46:59.600 --> 00:47:06.080
And they give you a song where you sing
a little bit of Afrikaans, Xhosa and English.

00:47:06.080 --> 00:47:08.000
A mixture of things.

00:47:08.000 --> 00:47:09.840
How can we be proud of such a thing?

00:47:09.840 --> 00:47:18.800
They've been indoctrinating our children since 1994,
with TV advertisements and programmes telling them

00:47:18.800 --> 00:47:21.840
about the new, so-called Rainbow Nation.

00:47:22.320 --> 00:47:26.320
And they can't have been very succesful
if we change that in nine days time.

00:47:27.200 --> 00:47:29.280
Then they are not very succesful.

00:47:29.280 --> 00:47:33.120
Everytime we have one of these camps,
we change it in nine days time.

00:47:33.120 --> 00:47:38.880
And then these kids see that they belong to a
different nation, they belong to a very proud nation.

00:47:38.880 --> 00:47:41.360
They will say, but we will show you,

00:47:41.360 --> 00:47:44.880
you white people, you can do nothing if we
change your names,

00:47:44.880 --> 00:47:48.000
if we change your flag, if we change
your national anthem,

00:47:48.000 --> 00:47:50.640
you can do nothing about it,
but through this camp, we will show them.

00:47:50.640 --> 00:47:53.120
Not just here though, but we will keep your names.

00:47:53.120 --> 00:47:54.400
We are going to move forward with you,

00:47:54.400 --> 00:47:57.120
and 1000 other boys will do this training too.

00:47:57.120 --> 00:48:01.760
We will show them, and we will fight
against what they're doing to us.

00:48:01.760 --> 00:48:06.720
One of the biggest goals of the camp is to
bring back patriotism into our boys:

00:48:06.720 --> 00:48:13.360
to teach them that they are not a part
of this artificially created Rainbow Nation,

00:48:13.840 --> 00:48:19.360
which has been pushed down their throats
since 1994,

00:48:19.360 --> 00:48:25.360
The children of our children won't have any idea
of where they come from.

00:48:25.360 --> 00:48:27.920
How can you move forward if you
don't know who you are?

00:48:27.920 --> 00:48:30.240
And that's what we are fighting for.

00:48:30.240 --> 00:48:32.640
What does the green stripe of the flag mean?

00:48:32.640 --> 00:48:39.600
The Western faith and the Africa... Afrikaner
come together and head towards the future together.

00:48:39.600 --> 00:48:46.800
The Western faith and the African faith come together
at one point and go into the future as one combined faith.

00:48:46.800 --> 00:48:49.280
Colonel Jooste showed us both flags,

00:48:49.280 --> 00:48:52.560
Winnie Mandela's g-string, that's the current national flag.

00:48:52.560 --> 00:48:54.400
And then we have our...

00:48:54.880 --> 00:48:56.000
orange, white, blue.

00:48:56.000 --> 00:49:01.120
He told us to choose the new flag
or the orange, white and blue.

00:49:01.920 --> 00:49:04.880
I think I will choose the orange, white, blue.

00:49:05.440 --> 00:49:08.240
It's much prettier, and it is..

00:49:09.040 --> 00:49:12.320
our Afrikaner blood's pride.

00:49:13.120 --> 00:49:16.720
I chose the current national flag.

00:49:17.200 --> 00:49:21.600
But I have an orange, white and blue flag
in my room.

00:49:23.280 --> 00:49:28.160
attended the camp for the first time
when I was 16.

00:49:28.960 --> 00:49:32.000
It was a training camp in Naboomspruit.

00:49:32.000 --> 00:49:35.680
One of my best friends invited me to the camp.

00:49:35.680 --> 00:49:38.480
In 2010 I started coming to the camps again.

00:49:38.480 --> 00:49:41.760
In the summer we did the basics camp again,

00:49:41.760 --> 00:49:46.160
and by the December camp
we started assisting as instructors.

00:49:46.160 --> 00:49:49.440
And we are still helping out as instructors,

00:49:49.440 --> 00:49:52.960
whilst we are busy with our officers courses.

00:49:53.600 --> 00:49:55.520
Can you identify him?

00:49:55.840 --> 00:49:56.640
Yes.

00:49:56.640 --> 00:49:58.000
You can see exactly who he is.

00:49:58.000 --> 00:49:59.520
It's not going to work.

00:49:59.840 --> 00:50:01.520
I've always wanted to go to the army,

00:50:01.520 --> 00:50:05.600
but our local army's standards are extremely low.

00:50:06.400 --> 00:50:09.200
And I want something that is with my people.

00:50:09.200 --> 00:50:11.200
We have a history to be proud of.

00:50:11.200 --> 00:50:13.040
Don't be ashamed of your history.

00:50:13.040 --> 00:50:15.040
We had everything taken by them.

00:50:15.040 --> 00:50:16.000
You must wake up.

00:50:16.000 --> 00:50:17.840
They stole almost everything from us.

00:50:17.840 --> 00:50:23.040
And you'll also learn that we are a nation
that has a right to have their own land.

00:50:23.040 --> 00:50:26.400
If the Swazi's have their own country
less than 500km away,

00:50:26.400 --> 00:50:28.640
the Swazi's have Swaziland.

00:50:28.640 --> 00:50:30.800
Then why can't the Afrikaners have Afrikanerland?

00:50:30.800 --> 00:50:33.440
For us there is only one way..

00:50:35.040 --> 00:50:38.080
to get independence, to fight for our freedom.

00:50:38.960 --> 00:50:41.040
For our own Fatherland.

00:50:55.440 --> 00:51:00.320
I'm now going to divide you into two groups.
One must hide away, and the other must patrol.

00:51:00.320 --> 00:51:03.200
We're going to drop you into the deep end,
straight into the shit!

00:51:03.200 --> 00:51:05.120
Okay, go hide.

00:51:39.360 --> 00:51:40.720
The guys like this.

00:51:41.680 --> 00:51:43.520
They really like this.

00:51:43.520 --> 00:51:45.200
They're going to shoot him

00:51:45.600 --> 00:51:46.720
now now.

00:51:49.440 --> 00:51:50.560
You know why?

00:51:50.560 --> 00:51:52.480
Where are the rest of his guys?

00:51:53.200 --> 00:51:54.960
He flanked them into the bush,

00:51:55.600 --> 00:51:57.360
and he's got no control over them.

00:51:57.360 --> 00:51:58.480
They're out of sight.

00:52:04.880 --> 00:52:06.960
They're out of sight, they're out of...

00:52:11.120 --> 00:52:13.200
You're dead, you bastard.

00:52:15.600 --> 00:52:17.760
Oh my fuck.

00:52:18.800 --> 00:52:21.120
Right, let's stand up.

00:52:21.120 --> 00:52:23.680
Because my patrol made a fuck up.

00:52:23.680 --> 00:52:24.640
Hello!

00:52:27.840 --> 00:52:29.840
Just one question.

00:52:30.480 --> 00:52:36.720
How willing are you to fight for your freedom?

00:52:37.360 --> 00:52:38.480
Completely.

00:52:39.760 --> 00:52:43.280
Everyday. Everything it takes of me.

00:52:44.000 --> 00:52:49.840
I got his feeling three weeks ago that my dad..
when I went so crazy,

00:52:49.840 --> 00:52:51.840
and used cocaine,

00:52:52.880 --> 00:52:59.680
I got the feeling... that he was watching me..

00:53:07.680 --> 00:53:11.200
from above... and it's..

00:53:15.280 --> 00:53:17.600
He wouldn't be happy.

00:53:19.600 --> 00:53:22.720
But, maybe now it'll be a bit better.

00:53:34.640 --> 00:53:38.720
So yes, I... have to get this right.

00:53:41.360 --> 00:53:45.840
I think he'd be proud of me for coming here.

00:54:05.360 --> 00:54:10.400
Get your team, you need to patrol the perimeter,
and you need to hurry up.

00:54:10.400 --> 00:54:12.240
Remember, you're sleeping out there tonight!

00:54:13.120 --> 00:54:17.520
You won't get your cover pitched in time.
You'll sleep in the wet and cold!

00:54:19.040 --> 00:54:24.080
We are going to have to build our own temporary base.

00:54:24.400 --> 00:54:27.520
So we're going into the bush to build it.

00:54:32.960 --> 00:54:33.840
It's too wet.

00:54:35.040 --> 00:54:39.760
It's too wet to put the sail up, we must sleep
on the sail, otherwise we aren't going to get any sleep.

00:54:39.760 --> 00:54:42.080
It's really a load of shit.

00:54:42.080 --> 00:54:43.520
This.

00:54:43.520 --> 00:54:46.000
You guys, come lie in the bush.

00:54:46.000 --> 00:54:48.880
So we can come and shoot you. Fucked up.

00:54:48.880 --> 00:54:51.760
And you can't sleep... Again!

00:54:51.760 --> 00:54:54.240
We must be wide awake. Understand?

00:54:54.240 --> 00:54:57.600
There is a lot of nice space
so that we can runaway if they come.

00:54:58.320 --> 00:54:59.840
- Small boy?
- Yeah?

00:54:59.840 --> 00:55:01.680
Small boy, you stay with me.

00:55:01.680 --> 00:55:02.800
Hear me?

00:55:02.800 --> 00:55:05.040
You fucking stay with me here.

00:55:05.040 --> 00:55:08.320
Don't show that, they'll know we're here.

00:55:19.520 --> 00:55:22.080
If you want to buy out a town.

00:55:22.080 --> 00:55:26.320
Go to the farmers, they can all put their farms together.
But their farms will still remain as their farms.

00:55:26.320 --> 00:55:27.520
Yes, they will!

00:55:27.520 --> 00:55:28.640
And move the town's borders.

00:55:28.640 --> 00:55:31.920
- That's what I'm saying... you don't buy it from them.
- It doesn't have to be...

00:55:31.920 --> 00:55:34.400
It stays 100% theirs.

00:55:34.400 --> 00:55:40.000
But they set it up as a new border point for our country.

00:55:40.000 --> 00:55:43.040
All I'm saying is use the outside.

00:55:43.040 --> 00:55:44.960
Use their stupidity.

00:55:44.960 --> 00:55:46.880
And strengthen yourself.

00:55:46.880 --> 00:55:49.280
Use them from the outside.

00:55:49.280 --> 00:55:52.000
Like a farmer, if he wants to be included,

00:55:53.200 --> 00:55:55.200
as a border for us,

00:55:56.640 --> 00:55:59.040
let him sell his corn to the outside.

00:55:59.520 --> 00:56:01.440
Here is his border.

00:56:03.440 --> 00:56:05.680
There is his house and his stuff.

00:56:05.680 --> 00:56:07.920
He comes in, he comes to work,

00:56:07.920 --> 00:56:10.400
six o' clock, he goes.

00:56:10.880 --> 00:56:13.200
- And the same goes for us?
Yes.

00:56:13.840 --> 00:56:17.040
If he has to leave my area at six,
I have to leave his area at six.

00:56:17.040 --> 00:56:18.960
Yes, that's all we need to do.

00:56:18.960 --> 00:56:23.600
Use them, as long as we need them.

00:56:25.120 --> 00:56:29.520
They're not going to think they're
being mistreated. No.

00:56:30.560 --> 00:56:31.920
They just see that life goes on.

00:56:31.920 --> 00:56:35.360
They see the money coming in,
because you have to pay them.

00:56:35.360 --> 00:56:39.600
Here comes the money. The money's coming.
So what. Okay. Yes, money comes. That's it.

00:57:14.000 --> 00:57:15.360
Who shot at us?

00:57:16.160 --> 00:57:17.520
Headboy, you bastard!

00:57:17.520 --> 00:57:18.880
Turn around.

00:57:18.880 --> 00:57:20.640
Turn. Go back.

00:57:21.280 --> 00:57:25.680
I only want to do this once to get the experience
and to see how the training is.

00:57:26.720 --> 00:57:29.520
I don't want to be an active..

00:57:32.000 --> 00:57:34.560
participant in the Kommandokorps.

00:57:34.560 --> 00:57:38.160
I just want to do the training to get the experience.

00:57:39.120 --> 00:57:42.560
We could see you from a mile away.

00:57:42.560 --> 00:57:46.000
We first heard you from way over on the other side

00:57:46.000 --> 00:57:48.640
and you led us straight to the base.

00:57:48.640 --> 00:57:51.680
You know this is a simulation of a real exercise.

00:57:52.240 --> 00:57:54.320
What would have happened if this was real?

00:57:57.040 --> 00:57:59.840
Once again the lookout fell asleep on duty,

00:57:59.840 --> 00:58:05.440
because your friends' lives obviously weren't
important enough to stay awake for.

00:58:07.920 --> 00:58:11.280
You all need to stand in a row for two shots
before you pack up.

00:58:11.280 --> 00:58:13.120
Just because you got caught.

00:58:25.360 --> 00:58:26.960
You've had your shots.

00:58:28.160 --> 00:58:30.160
I'm starting the stop watch.

00:58:30.160 --> 00:58:35.360
You have eight minutes to get
all the gear back to base camp.

00:58:35.360 --> 00:58:36.240
Move!

00:58:37.120 --> 00:58:42.080
As a son of the AWB, I begin at camps like these.

00:58:42.480 --> 00:58:44.320
The AWB stands for

00:58:44.880 --> 00:58:47.920
the Afrikaner Resistance Movement,

00:58:47.920 --> 00:58:51.440
and here, as you can see, the three sevens,

00:58:52.000 --> 00:58:56.080
are not really like Hitler's Swastika, as people say.

00:58:56.800 --> 00:59:02.560
They're the three sevens that oppose
the 666 of the Anti-Christ in the Bible.

00:59:02.560 --> 00:59:03.520
The Beast.

00:59:03.520 --> 00:59:06.400
So the three sevens is the perfect number,

00:59:06.400 --> 00:59:09.760
of our God and his glory.

00:59:09.760 --> 00:59:12.880
God, our people and Fatherland.

00:59:12.880 --> 00:59:14.320
That's what it stands for.

00:59:14.320 --> 00:59:18.000
It's not racist, nor is it about racism.

00:59:18.480 --> 00:59:22.640
It's about who you are, what you are
and what you stand for.

00:59:23.440 --> 00:59:26.080
We believe that this is part of a bigger plan

00:59:26.080 --> 00:59:29.760
to the eliminate an entire nation.

00:59:29.760 --> 00:59:31.840
This is why we give them the training.

00:59:32.320 --> 00:59:37.600
We don't give them attack training but rather
discipline and self defense training.

00:59:37.600 --> 00:59:40.880
We must learn how to bring our people together again.

00:59:40.880 --> 00:59:42.720
On certain dates you can see,

00:59:42.720 --> 00:59:44.560
if you put certain dates together,

00:59:44.560 --> 00:59:47.440
you can see exactly when a war will erupt.

00:59:47.440 --> 00:59:51.920
We are now in that phase - where we are
waitingfor them to attack us.

00:59:51.920 --> 00:59:55.440
And believe me, we're waiting for them to attack first.

00:59:55.440 --> 00:59:57.760
And that day... they'll run.

00:59:57.760 --> 00:59:59.280
They're going to run into the sea.

00:59:59.280 --> 01:00:02.240
Because we're going to turn around
and start shooting back.

01:00:06.320 --> 01:00:07.840
This is one of our anthems.

01:00:11.280 --> 01:00:13.840
On a mountain in the night

01:00:13.840 --> 01:00:17.040
we lie in darkness and wait.

01:00:20.320 --> 01:00:23.760
I lie cold in the mud and blood,

01:00:23.760 --> 01:00:27.920
my bag and the rain cling to me.

01:00:27.920 --> 01:00:30.800
My Bible says I mustn't mix with them.

01:00:30.800 --> 01:00:33.680
According to my country's history and the like,

01:00:33.680 --> 01:00:36.240
look at what happened at Blood River.

01:00:36.880 --> 01:00:39.680
Piet Retief and his men wanted to negotiate,
and they murdered him.

01:00:39.680 --> 01:00:43.600
And I can no longer allow our people to be wiped out.

01:00:43.600 --> 01:00:47.360
The day that WVK tell me,
"we're picking up our weapons"

01:00:47.360 --> 01:00:50.960
I will pick up my weapon and go with my people.

01:00:50.960 --> 01:00:56.720
De La Rey, De la Rey
Will you lead the Afrikaners?

01:01:00.160 --> 01:01:02.880
General, General.

01:01:02.880 --> 01:01:08.560
We will follow you as one man.
General De La Rey.

01:01:08.560 --> 01:01:10.160
If we don't get our land,

01:01:10.160 --> 01:01:15.840
if they don't want to accept that
we are an independent nation

01:01:15.840 --> 01:01:21.920
and we strive for our freedom, then it's a freedom
struggle, we will start a freedom struggle.

01:01:21.920 --> 01:01:25.760
like all the other nations in this world.

01:01:43.120 --> 01:01:45.040
We have the ability.

01:01:45.040 --> 01:01:46.960
We have the men.

01:01:48.320 --> 01:01:50.880
We just need to plant the will in you,

01:01:50.880 --> 01:01:55.920
because you've been brainwashed
by old Mandela and all that stuff.

01:01:55.920 --> 01:01:58.880
Be proud of your people, be proud of your race.

01:01:59.440 --> 01:02:02.960
Be proud of your faith, be proud of your culture.

01:02:02.960 --> 01:02:05.680
You have the right to be proud.

01:02:05.680 --> 01:02:08.960
I'm not forcing this down your throat
because you came here willingly

01:02:08.960 --> 01:02:11.120
That makes you better than us.

01:02:12.080 --> 01:02:14.480
Why does it make you better than us?

01:02:15.680 --> 01:02:17.760
Because it was compulsory for you.

01:02:18.160 --> 01:02:21.920
We had to. We were called up with conscription papers.

01:02:21.920 --> 01:02:25.120
We were forced to do it.
We were forced by the government.

01:02:25.120 --> 01:02:28.240
Most of those guys wouldn't
have been there if they weren't ordered.

01:02:28.240 --> 01:02:30.080
You've come voluntarily.

01:02:30.080 --> 01:02:33.760
Well, not entirely voluntarily, because you
thought it was all about paintball, didn't you?

01:02:34.640 --> 01:02:37.840
So we needed to camouflage it a bit for you.

01:02:37.840 --> 01:02:40.640
But you've heard what I've said now,
we don't want to make war.

01:02:41.280 --> 01:02:42.720
Nobody wants to make war.

01:02:43.600 --> 01:02:45.680
It's not a nice thing to make war.

01:02:45.920 --> 01:02:47.840
But if you have to do it..

01:02:48.880 --> 01:02:51.040
don't see that person as a person..

01:02:53.040 --> 01:02:56.160
see him as a mark that you have to eliminate.

01:02:56.800 --> 01:03:00.160
Eliminate the mark and put it behind you.

01:03:00.720 --> 01:03:03.520
And don't let it screw with your head.

01:03:05.040 --> 01:03:07.280
Otherwise you'll go crazy.

01:03:07.360 --> 01:03:14.160
I would like to be a member of the
Kommandokorps as a Sergeant or something

01:03:14.720 --> 01:03:17.200
National salute!

01:03:17.760 --> 01:03:22.320
Ringing out from our blue heavens.

01:03:22.320 --> 01:03:26.960
From our deep seas breaking round.

01:03:26.960 --> 01:03:32.080
Over everlasting mountains.

01:03:32.080 --> 01:03:37.280
Where the echoing crags resound.

01:03:37.280 --> 01:03:42.160
In the Bible it says black people must live with black
people and white people must live with white people.

01:03:42.160 --> 01:03:45.280
You cannot mix nations.

01:03:45.280 --> 01:03:47.200
I don't have black friends.

01:03:47.200 --> 01:03:50.960
If they can stay on their side, I can stay on mine.

01:03:50.960 --> 01:03:52.400
Then there's no problem.

01:03:52.400 --> 01:03:57.360
If they come to my side and
ask to speak to me, I will say no.

01:03:58.480 --> 01:04:00.640
Or I will turn my back on them and walk away.

01:04:05.840 --> 01:04:08.880
The AWB is just like the Kommandokorps.

01:04:08.880 --> 01:04:12.000
There are lots of right-wing groups.

01:04:12.880 --> 01:04:15.280
It's more about self-defense.

01:04:15.280 --> 01:04:19.040
If they say the black people are
attacking white people,

01:04:19.040 --> 01:04:20.720
the AWB will come in,

01:04:20.720 --> 01:04:25.680
and they will say, "You need to leave,
or we will shoot you."

01:04:25.680 --> 01:04:29.680
Then the black people will hit the road,
and all the other races.

01:04:32.160 --> 01:04:34.240
Stay behind the camera guys.

01:04:37.600 --> 01:04:38.720
Don't record them, ok?

01:04:38.720 --> 01:04:39.440
Ok.

01:04:39.920 --> 01:04:40.800
You, come here.

01:04:51.360 --> 01:04:53.440
We Afrikaners want our freedom.

01:04:54.080 --> 01:04:56.160
We want our own country

01:04:56.160 --> 01:05:00.480
We will continue to burn
this flag until the day we get our freedom.

01:05:03.680 --> 01:05:06.960
No one will force us to stand under this flag.

01:05:10.160 --> 01:05:11.760
We Afrikaners want our freedom.

01:05:11.760 --> 01:05:13.760
We want our own country.

01:05:14.080 --> 01:05:15.840
We Afrikaners want our freedom.

01:05:15.840 --> 01:05:17.520
We want our own country.

01:05:17.920 --> 01:05:19.680
We Afrikaners want our freedom.

01:05:19.680 --> 01:05:21.360
We want our own country

01:05:21.840 --> 01:05:23.600
We Afrikaners want our freedom.

01:05:23.600 --> 01:05:25.120
We want our own country.

01:05:25.680 --> 01:05:27.440
We Afrikaners want our freedom.

01:05:27.440 --> 01:05:29.040
We want our own country.

01:05:29.600 --> 01:05:31.360
We Afrikaners want our freedom.

01:05:31.360 --> 01:05:32.960
We want our own country.

01:05:34.000 --> 01:05:35.360
Burn, bastard, burn.

01:05:35.760 --> 01:05:37.280
Burn, bastard, burn.

01:05:37.760 --> 01:05:39.360
Burn, bastard, burn.

01:05:39.600 --> 01:05:43.840
As we long as we Afrikaners are ruled by a
communist regime, we will burn that thing.

01:05:43.840 --> 01:05:47.120
It's not our flag and no communist will rule us.

01:06:08.720 --> 01:06:11.200
If they burn it they burn it, I can't stop it.

01:06:11.200 --> 01:06:13.360
But they will..

01:06:14.800 --> 01:06:17.040
they will carry the consequences.

01:06:17.040 --> 01:06:22.400
I was singing because it made me feel pr. not proud,
but it made me feel like part of the group.

01:06:22.400 --> 01:06:24.720
I didn't want to just stand there and
keep my mouth shut.

01:06:24.720 --> 01:06:27.040
I wouldn't burn the flag myself.

01:06:27.760 --> 01:06:28.560
To put it that way.

01:06:29.840 --> 01:06:35.040
I liked it when I saw the flag burn.

01:06:36.960 --> 01:06:39.120
That fucking shit flag.

01:06:39.840 --> 01:06:41.440
Because I don't like it.

01:06:42.640 --> 01:06:44.480
Remember I'm not as young as these guys.

01:06:45.680 --> 01:06:49.280
I know about our old flag. I know about 1994.

01:06:49.280 --> 01:06:51.680
I know what my father lost.

01:06:53.360 --> 01:06:57.040
For me it's plainly and simply - a shit flag.

01:06:57.040 --> 01:06:58.640
It doesn't bother me at all.

01:06:58.640 --> 01:07:00.800
Burn the damn thing.

01:07:00.800 --> 01:07:05.040
If we're called up to stand together as one

01:07:05.040 --> 01:07:09.280
to get our own nation, to get our own country,

01:07:10.000 --> 01:07:11.600
I will stand with them.

01:07:11.600 --> 01:07:15.200
I believe all the men here will also stand together.

01:07:15.680 --> 01:07:17.680
Our people will stand together as one.

01:07:18.320 --> 01:07:21.040
To get our own freedom.

01:07:21.040 --> 01:07:23.440
My mind has changed a lot about black people.

01:07:23.440 --> 01:07:25.040
The negativity has grown.

01:07:25.040 --> 01:07:30.960
Colonel Frans has opened our eyes to all
the bad things that black people do.

01:07:30.960 --> 01:07:33.440
They won't change.

01:07:37.760 --> 01:07:39.680
I didn't...

01:07:39.680 --> 01:07:43.440
participate in the burning of the flag completely,

01:07:43.440 --> 01:07:47.840
because I don't want to disgrace that flag,

01:07:48.480 --> 01:07:53.760
because one day when I'm in the airforce, I'm going
to fight for that flag and I want to be proud of it.

01:08:02.400 --> 01:08:08.400
Look here, everyone's got their opinions.
I don't like these black people. That's the truth.

01:08:08.400 --> 01:08:12.000
You can tell everyone in the whole world.
I don't like black people.

01:08:12.000 --> 01:08:19.600
The truth about this whole thing and why I'm here is
for me to get training, if the black nation attacks us.

01:08:19.600 --> 01:08:22.400
If that nation attacks, I'll know what to do.

01:08:23.600 --> 01:08:24.800
It is a guarantee.

01:08:24.800 --> 01:08:26.840
There will be a war in this country.

